+- PR #1174 head is no longer exactly `7a3f9d...` at start;
+- the branch, repository, worktree, or origin is wrong;
+- the worktree is dirty before packet files are added;
+- packet or canonical proof paths already exist unexpectedly;
+- the allowed signer principal or matching local private key is unavailable;
+- any private key content is printed, logged, staged, or copied;
+- `C1` contains anything beyond the packet pair;
+- the PR base changes after audit-bundle capture and before proof creation;
+- AGY/Claude audit tool or exact Sonnet model cannot be proven;
+- the audit verdict is not passing;
+- the audit does not bind exact `C1`;
+- findings require source or test changes;
+- proof JSON names `C2` instead of `C1`;
+- proof validation or signature verification fails;
+- staged or committed `C2` paths escape the canonical proof prefix;
+- local acceptance returns `accepted=false`;
+- any tracked edit occurs after `C2`;
+- push would require force;
+- trusted audit or final-readiness workflow fails;
+- new unclassified reviewer, bot, comment, thread, or check appears;
+- merge is requested without separate operator authorization.
+
+If stopped, return:
+
+1. exact stop condition;
+2. current PR head and local head;
+3. `C1` and `C2` if created;
+4. actions attempted;
+5. evidence and logs captured;
+6. unchanged-state confirmation where possible;
+7. next evidence or packet amendment required.
